1. d4 d5 2. c4 e6 {Support d5 with a pawn.} 3. Nc3 Nf6
{Develop and add another defender to d5.} 4. Bg5 Be7 {Unpin the knight from the queen.}
5. e3 O-O {Get the king safe. Later, look for a timely ...c5.} *

